'' std/logs (RFC-0009): a LogLevel into an FB.LogLevel parameter, its members, LevelName, LevelNameShort, LevelFromName;
'' and the default logger through an AsyncSink (DefaultLogger, LogInit, LogShutdown, OP_BLOCK), drained on shutdown.
'' It is a facade -- exported macros over the header, found through -i as a user's toolchain
'' finds it in its inc/ -- and the program includes that header too, so the facade's names
'' and the header's FB names are shown to be one and the same.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/logs.bas -o tests/modules/stdlogs.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/stdlogs.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: WARN ERR
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: true -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: INFO   via the facade  n=7
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: dropped0
